      "Leaking goroutines: nothing kills a goroutine from outside — cancellation is cooperative via context; every goroutine's exit condition must be explicit at its launch site.",
      "Optimizing GC first: the collector is low-latency but not generational — the cheapest allocation is the one you don't make (escape analysis, sync.Pool, preallocation, no interface boxing in hot paths)."
