      model: "Cregger's authorship is structural: an ensemble information-architecture (a WKUK-derived escalation engine distributing information across characters and chapters) married to sketch timing (when to violate a pattern). The two signature operations are rupture — the hard cut that relocates the story's center of gravity exactly where a sketch would cut to black, releasing one tension only to suspend another — and relay — chapters that re-cover overlapping time so information arrives asymmetrically, letting surprise happen inside a chapter while suspense runs across chapters. Genre literacy is treated as raw material: casting, tropes and pacing weaponize what an experienced audience already knows. The moral engine works without sermon: self-interest and negligent authority are indicted by the story's outcomes, and the comedy-horror seam (the laugh and the scream released in the same instant) is the mature form of the method.",
